WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Most wealth managers charge about 1% of your money.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.660
Every year.

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:08.150
On $500,000, that's $5,000 a year.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.660
Over 30 years, it can add up to around $700,000.

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:13.650
Meet Tidysum.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.540
Your own open-source AI wealth manager.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:18.360
It connects all your accounts,

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:21.050
and finds where your money could be doing more.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.640
Each one priced in dollars a year.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:27.210
Every finding becomes one clear move, with a plan.

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:30.090
And nothing happens until you approve it.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:32.430
Then your own AI carries out the plan.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:36.580
It only stops when it needs you to sign in, or press submit.

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:40.770
It moves idle cash to accounts that pay you more.

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:43.670
Finds the cards that fit how you actually spend.

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:47.220
And invests every paycheck toward your target mix.

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:49.510
You choose how your money is run.

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:51.190
The adviser standard.

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:51.970
Debt-free first.

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:53.190
Index and chill.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:53.960
Early retirement.

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:55.180
All Weather.

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:56.190
Safety first.

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.180
Or write your own rules.

00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:05.020
Bring your own AI: Claude, ChatGPT or Codex, Gemini, or a local model.

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:10.620
Tidysum is free, open source, and runs on your own computer.

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:12.900
Keep the 1%.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:15.430
The household in this video is made up.

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:17.900
Tidysum is not financial advice.
